    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A grieving girl. A broken world. A path soaked in blood and memory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashen Daughter is a hand-drawn Metroidvania set in a crumbling world where the old gods have fallen silent. Play as K\u00e1ra, a young woman resurrected by the Whisperer. Driven by vengeance but shadowed by grief, she must face corrupted emissaries, buried memories, and the sins of her own family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined villages, enchanted forests, and lightless caverns. Unlock powerful abilities, uncover the fate of your people, and decide whether forgiveness is possible in a world built on sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned Metroidvania player or simply drawn to a beautifully told story you can explore at your own pace, Ashen Daughter offers a deeply emotional journey with fluid controls, meaningful choices, and a world worth getting lost in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Responsive and satisfying movement &amp; combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Hand-drawn 2D world inspired by Norse folklore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Blood Bargains: Sacrifice your health for powerful, lasting upgrades to fuel your fury</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Emotional story of vengeance, grief, and forgiveness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A challenging yet approachable Metroidvania experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.poster.avif?t=1755589418\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.webm?t=1755589418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.mp4?t=1755589418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A grieving girl. A broken world. A path soaked in blood and memory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashen Daughter is a hand-drawn Metroidvania set in a crumbling world where the old gods have fallen silent. Play as K\u00e1ra, a young woman resurrected by the Whisperer. Driven by vengeance but shadowed by grief, she must face corrupted emissaries, buried memories, and the sins of her own family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined villages, enchanted forests, and lightless caverns. Unlock powerful abilities, uncover the fate of your people, and decide whether forgiveness is possible in a world built on sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned Metroidvania player or simply drawn to a beautifully told story you can explore at your own pace, Ashen Daughter offers a deeply emotional journey with fluid controls, meaningful choices, and a world worth getting lost in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Responsive and satisfying movement &amp; combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Hand-drawn 2D world inspired by Norse folklore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Blood Bargains: Sacrifice your health for powerful, lasting upgrades to fuel your fury</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Emotional story of vengeance, grief, and forgiveness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A challenging yet approachable Metroidvania experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.poster.avif?t=1755589418\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.webm?t=1755589418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.mp4?t=1755589418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Battle corrupted emissaries, explore a mythical world, and sacrifice health for power in this hand-drawn Metroidvania. With tight, responsive controls, guide K\u00e1ra on a journey of grief, vengeance, and forgiveness.",
